# Purchase Order live files

App owns data/assets/output/config.py. PE + Tags + ShipStation secrets are shared.

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `Purchase Order Generator/data/Database.xlsx` | Product DB for slips |
| `Purchase Order Generator/data/Packs Database.xlsx` | Packs |
| `Purchase Order Generator/data/stock_levels_*.csv` | BTC free stock |
| `data/shipstation/ShipStation_Tags.xlsx` | Shared tags |
| `data/product_export/ProductExport.csv` | Shared PE |
| `Custom Label Database/Custom_Label_Database.csv` | BTC SKU |
| `Purchase Order Generator/assets/` | brand_logos / product_images |
| `Purchase Order Generator/output/` | Run outputs |
| `config/ShipStation/.env` | ShipStation `REAL_API_*` |
| `Purchase Order Generator/config.py` | FTP/stock settings (never commit) |
